flowchart TD
    I[Counts matrix or FASTQ] --> DA[DataAuditAgent]
    DA --> D[DesignAgent]
    D --> A[AuditAgent]
    A --> BR[BulkRNAAgent]
    BR --> T{FASTQ input?}
    T -->|yes| FQ[rna_fastq_qc.py]
    FQ --> ALN[rna_align.py]
    ALN --> QNT[rna_quantify.py]
    QNT --> COUNTS[Counts matrix]
    T -->|no| COUNTS
    COUNTS --> DESIGN[Confirmed design or fallback inference]
    DESIGN --> DE[rna_bulk_de.py]
    DE --> QC[Sample QC]
    DE --> PW[ORA + GSEA]
    DE --> FIG[Volcano, PCA/MDS, heatmaps]
    QC --> N[NarrativeAgent]
    PW --> N[NarrativeAgent]
    FIG --> N
    N --> R[HTML report + methods + tables]
